+### 4.2 真实数据增量验证
+
+```bash
+sshpass -p "$(cat ~/.aiquant_sealed/sg_pass)" ssh \
+  -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no root@43.160.200.224 '
+set -e
+P=/opt/ai_quant_liq_collector/data/LIQUIDATIONS/liq_$(date -u +%Y%m%d).jsonl
+date -u +"before %Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ"
